## Node name (for distributed Erlang / remsh)
-name pertisk_eproxy@127.0.0.1

## Cookie for distributed Erlang (change in production)
-setcookie pertisk_eproxy_cookie

## Heartbeat monitor (restart VM on crash)
## -heart

## Async thread pool
+A 32

## Maximum number of ports (file descriptors)
+Q 65536

## Increase process limit
+P 1048576

## Enable kernel poll
+K true
